# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# prof_all_shapes.rt  —  PHYSICS PROFILING MAP
#
# Goal:  isolate per-shape-type integrator + contact-detection cost.
#        Equal count of every shape (20 each = 140 dynamic bodies total).
#        Solid diffuse only, 1 key light, no emissive, no textures, no mesh.
#        All shapes fall onto a static floor and collide with each other.
#
# Run:
#   valgrind --tool=callgrind --callgrind-out-file=callgrind_phys_shapes.out \
#     ./miniRT-prof maps/rt/physics/prof_all_shapes.rt
#   callgrind_annotate --auto=yes callgrind_phys_shapes.out | head -80
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

